# A nested full copy of this repo inside itself (~9.9MB), including a local
# .claude/settings.local.json. Created by a clone or copy run from inside the
# repo rather than its parent. Ignored rather than deleted — remove by hand
# once you have confirmed nothing in it is wanted.
/roadys-command-center/

# Shell-quoting accident, Oct 21 2026: a mangled grep argument became a
# redirect target, so this file is ANSI-coloured grep output. Safe to delete.
elect(*

# The MGM refresh-script fixtures are deliberately committed: they are tiny,
# synthetic, and they are the only test input for tools/refresh-membership-config.py.
# The blanket *.csv rule above would otherwise swallow them.
!tools/fixtures/*.csv

# Written on request as a verbatim transcript of one reply about rewards
# calibration. It quotes blended $/member/mo and $/member/yr figures for 2024,
# 2025 and 2026 alongside the member base for each year -- which multiply back
# into two exact P&L line totals. The repo is public, so this stays local.
# The 2026 figures it argues for are committed in membershipModelConfig.js as
# drivers by explicit decision; the prior-year ones are not, and this file is
# the only place they appear.
/last-response.md

# MCP client noise, captured by a stray redirect. Safe to delete.
/session-log.txt
